1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
What do you do every day? Tell your whole routine in English — in seven sentences.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Today you will learn to talk about your day: wake up, work, eat, sleep.

3
00:00:49,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Seven key sentences. First, just listen to the dialogue.

4
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Good morning, Omar! What time do you wake up?

5
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:38,000
Hi, Maya. I usually wake up at seven o’clock.

6
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:49,000
Seven? That’s early! I get up at eight.

7
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Do you have breakfast at home?

8
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:08,000
Yes, I always have coffee and toast. And you?

9
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Me too. Then I go to work at nine.

10
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:33,000
I start work at nine thirty and finish at five.

11
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:43,000
In the evening, I cook dinner and watch TV.

12
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:56,000
I read a book before bed. I sleep at eleven.

13
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:05,000
A busy day! But I like my routine.

14
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Good morning.

15
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:48,000
