39
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:52,000
Listen to Maya, learn the sentence by heart, then say it out loud in the gap — three times.

40
00:08:52,000 --> 00:09:02,000
I wake up at __________.

41
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:15,000
I usually __________ in the morning.

42
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:27,000
I go to __________ at nine.

43
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:38,000
In the evening, I __________.

44
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:50,000
I go to bed at __________.

45
00:09:50,000 --> 00:10:12,000
How do you ask about the time of a routine?

46
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:34,000
Where do “usually” and “always” go in the sentence?

47
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:53,000
